      <abstract>
        <para>&firewalld; is a dynamic firewall management service in &productname; that provides precise control over incoming and outgoing network traffic. By abstracting complex netfilter rules into intuitive zones and predefined services, &firewalld; enables administrators to modify network security policies dynamically without disrupting active client connections or requiring full system restarts.</para>
  <para><emphasis role="bold">Prerequisites</emphasis></para>
  <itemizedlist>
    <listitem>
      <para>&sudo; or &rootuser; administrative privileges</para>
    </listitem>
    <listitem>
      <para>The <package>firewalld</package> package installed on the system</para>
    </listitem>
    <listitem>
      <para>Basic familiarity with the Linux command-line terminal</para>
    </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
      </abstract>
